{"ref":"character:antonio-belpaese","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Antonio Belpaese is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors. He is the character that every player begins with. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:whip"}," ",{"t":"Whip","r":"weapon:whip"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Antonio"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["ANTONIO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Whip.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:whip"}," ",{"t":"Whip","r":"weapon:whip"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Available by default."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[["Free"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["120"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+1"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Antonio starts with +20 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," and +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},". He gains +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}," every 10 levels until level 50. The maximum Might gained this way is +50%."]},{"k":"p","c":["The following table shows how much Might he gains by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Might"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-9"]},{"c":["0%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["10-19"]},{"c":["+10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["20-29"]},{"c":["+20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["30-39"]},{"c":["+30%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["40-49"]},{"c":["+40%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["50+"]},{"c":["+50%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-sprites","title":"Sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Antonio_Belpaese.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Default Antonio sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Antonio_Belpaese_(Legacy).png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Legacy Antonio sprite."]},{"i":"Sprite-Antonio_Belpaese_(Menu).png","w":120,"h":71,"c":["Antonio's sprite in the Main Menu."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-animated-sprites","title":"Animated sprites","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Antonio_Belpaese.gif","w":116,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of default Antonio."]},{"i":"Animated-Antonio_Belpaese_(Legacy).gif","w":112,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation of legacy Antonio."]}]}]},{"id":"gallery-other","title":"Other","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Vampire_Survivors_-_main_menu_cover_art.jpg","w":200,"h":90,"c":["Antonio with his ",{"t":"Whip","r":"weapon:whip"}," as depicted in the main menu cover art (center)."]},{"i":"Antonio_Belpaese_-_OtC_trailer.png","w":179,"h":150,"c":["Antonio as seen in the ",{"t":"pre-release trailer","x":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aGAlK-DIeAE"}," of Ode to Castlevania."]},{"i":"Ode_to_Castlevania_short_-_Antonio_sheet.png","w":200,"h":86,"c":["Official Ode to Castlevania pre-release trailer model sheet."]},{"i":"Vampire_Survivors_1_-_comic_book_cover.jpg","w":99,"h":150,"c":["Antonio in the main cover of the first issue of the Vampire Survivors comic book series."]}]}]}]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 June 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Default skin added to game."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 2 March 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," and ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," bonus for Antonio."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 12 December 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added walking animation for Antonio."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Antonio's family name Belpaese is derived from the phrase Bel Paese, which is Italian for \"beautiful country\", and also refers to a semi-soft Italian cheese with the same name."]},{"c":["Antonio's family name, overall design, and use of a ",{"t":"whip","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Whip"}," as his primary weapon are all nods to the ",{"t":"Belmont family","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Belmont_Clan"},", the clan of vampire slayers known for slaying ",{"t":"Dracula","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Dracula"}," several times in the ",{"t":"Castlevania","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania"}," series."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["His Adventure mode shop quote, \"What a wonderful night to hunt beasts!\" is an ironic reference to the famous line \"What a horrible night to have a curse.\" from Castlevania II: Simon's Quest."]},{"c":["The color scheme of his hair and clothing have a ",{"t":"striking resemblance","x":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/castlevania/images/6/62/Simon-hc.gif"}," to Simon Belmont in Haunted Castle."]}]}},{"c":["Antonio is the one of two free characters in the game, the other being ",{"i":"Sprite-Queen_Sigma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:queen-sigma"}," ",{"t":"Queen Sigma","r":"character:queen-sigma"},"."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["However, Antonio is the only one that is obtainable at the start of the game. Unlocking Queen Sigma requires for the player to complete the Collection 1.0."]},{"c":["Including DLCs, Antonio is one of six free characters, as Ode to Castlevania introduces four more."]}]}}]}],"subs":[{"id":"trivia-in-other-media","title":"In other media","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Antonio Belpaese makes an appearance in the idle farming simulation game ",{"t":"Rusty's Retirement","x":"https://rustys-retirement.fandom.com/wiki/Rusty%27s_Retirement"},", as part of that game's update that includes Vampire Survivors content. He is a reskin of ",{"t":"Haiku","x":"https://rustys-retirement.fandom.com/wiki/Haiku"}," in that game."]}]}]}]}]}